WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,660
Indeed I sent it

2
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:04,890
Is there something wrong with this hairpin?

3
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:07,170
Just admit it

4
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:11,290
This hairpin has been smeared with peach branches.

5
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,800
I don't know anything about this.

6
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:16,480
The hairpin was given away by you and you have nothing to do with it.

7
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:17,840
Awan said this

8
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,960
Even if you don’t say much, it will take half a month.

9
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,840
If this matter spreads,

10
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,120
It's not a good thing for your reputation either.

11
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,340
I don't want to make things worse either.

12
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,580
If you really want to make amends

13
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,450
Then he went to persuade the prince

14
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:32,250
Standing for your elder brother in court

15
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:33,890
Get a decent job

16
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:36,930
I will end this matter

17
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:38,330
We can't just let it go

18
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:40,210
If my cousin is really sincere

19
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:42,330
I'd better apologize to my sixth sister first.

20
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:44,250
Otherwise, wait until the old lady comes back

21
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:46,490
This matter reached the ears of her old man

22
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:49,190
I'm afraid it will end badly
